  <item>
    <title>KKTalks EP38 职业焦虑怎么办？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64ba0174d0844ea81226552d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64ba0174d0844ea81226552d</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 21 Jul 2023 03:54:26 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这一期，我们聊聊职业焦虑的话题，公司有可能裁员怎么办？投资不成功怎么办……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="21">00:21</a> 人人都有和财富有关的焦虑；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="82">01:22</a> 时代的变革给每个人都带来冲击；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="255">04:15</a> 90 年代的时候，有过一拨类似的冲击；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="392">06:32</a> 很多时候换个角度来思考，会豁然开朗；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="499">08:19</a> 先盘点一下自己的基本盘，作为思考和出发的起点；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="639">10:39</a> 如何思考让自己具有价值链上的优势地位；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="851">14:11</a> 焦虑的反义词是具体，行动起来，就可以对抗焦虑；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="933">15:33</a> 大佬的例子，大佬身段都很柔软，我们普通人更应该open；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1090">18:10</a> 如何拓圈子，学技能；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1306">21:46</a> 很多焦虑是由于闭塞；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1503">25:03</a> 不知道学什么怎么办；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1574">26:14</a> 学习的底层逻辑是可以迁移的；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1734">28:54</a> 如何使用互联网，决定了人与人的巨大区别；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1765">29:25</a> 关于创业的认知；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1990">33:10</a> 大佬也焦虑，只是能共处；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2191">36:31</a> 我们是时代大潮中的小水滴，保持open；</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>KK：KKTalks 播客主理人，热爱读书和效率工具的双子座。一个从理性读书出发，歪楼到占星的成长博主。</span><strong><span>公众号：KK书话</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Grace：一个看清真相还依然热爱生活的摩羯座。</span><br><span></span><strong><span>微信：PsychicTarot &nbsp;公众号：Grace看星盘</span></strong></p>]]></description>
