  <item>
    <title>KKTalks EP37 水相星座的性格特点</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64afd5636dab8896d1f31598</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64afd5636dab8896d1f31598</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 13 Jul 2023 10:43:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这一期，我们专门讨论水相星座，特点以及容易给自己带来的困扰的常见的一些情绪，收听愉快，夏天快乐~~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="42">00:42</a> KK 夸一夸双子的优点；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="95">01:35</a> 双子座来占星都在问啥？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="134">02:14</a> 水相来咨询就不一样啦~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="339">05:39</a> 同样的事情，给水相和风相的人带来的感受是差非常多的；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="352">05:52</a> 分手这件事，水相、风相、火相、土相的表现完全不一样；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="502">08:22</a> 天秤的表现；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="526">08:46</a> 水相的表现；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="659">10:59</a> 水相被卡在过去的情感里怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="728">12:08</a> KK 见过的例子；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="813">13:33</a> Grace 的建议；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="943">15:43</a> 水相有一种情绪弥漫的特质；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1150">19:10</a> 火相的人会怎么处理分手这件事？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1228">20:28</a> 土相的人会怎么处理分手这件事？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1332">22:12</a> 水相星座能量强的姑娘要不……还是找个水相的？好处就是能共情，坏处就是会互相激发；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1415">23:35</a> 水相搞不定自己的情绪，对事业是有很大影响的；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1564">26:04</a> 巨蟹的老板就是搞不明白，为什么对下属那……么好，人家还离职；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1782">29:42</a> 情绪处理不好，会影响财运哦~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2009">33:29</a> 水相来咨询，是真的困扰；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2266">37:46</a> 水相遇到好的感情，就被疗愈了；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2383">39:43</a> 水相的情绪要自我觉察，很容易成为一个bug；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2486">41:26</a> 了解自己，了解对方很重要；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2535">42:15</a> 一种特别容易被 PUA 的情感逻辑；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2748">45:48</a> 水相的小朋友是怎么来调节自己的情绪的？欢迎来留言呀~~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2785">46:25</a> 水相的小朋友要特别注意身边的人是不是来消耗你的；</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>听友福利：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>森林先知果冻起泡酒专属福利（我看海报上优惠截止时间是 7 月 31 日）：</span></p><span></span><p><span>淘口令：99 CZ3457 &nbsp;666:/🔐JDxAdHZBHGi🗝</span></p><span></span><p><span>（KK 碎碎念：我点进淘宝看了下，优惠后是 59 块 6 瓶，我觉得还行~~，夏天听节目的时候喝果冻酒觉得蛮搭的。啊……我真是一个卖力的up主啊~）</span></p>]]></description>
